          "status": "canonical"
        }
      ],
      "rule": "One uninterrupted pale stucco surface - white, cream, or a light sand tone ('bright, plain, and slightly severe'; description.long). This reverses the inherited Downing landscape-tone rule, which explicitly prohibits white on the body; here pale or white is canonical.",
      "status": "drafted"
    },
