          "kind": "measured",
          "note": "Own typical_ratios states 'wall openings 1:1.6 to 1:2.2' (height:width); expressed here as width:height = 0.45-0.625. A plain, moderately vertical proportion, not the wide horizontal multi-light grid otherwise inherited."
        }
      },
      "rule": "Wall openings 1:1.6 to 1:2.2, cut plainly with a 3-6 in reveal and no applied casing.",
